      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "dbt Deep Mental Model\ndbt is easiest to reason about as a compiler plus an\nexecution planner over warehouse relations. The\nuseful mental model is not \"SQL files in folders\"; it is\nmetadata, dependencies, environment-specific\nrelation resolution, and materialization behavior.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 22.5,
      "containerId": "node-68f563178db5",
      "originalText": "dbt Deep Mental Model\ndbt is easiest to reason about as a compiler plus an execution planner over warehouse relations. The useful mental model is not \"SQL files in folders\"; it is metadata, dependencies, environment-specific relation resolution, and materialization behavior.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-deep-mental-model"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
