      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Load Invocation Context\nResolve the invocation before reading resources: command name, project directory, profile or\nconnection profile, target, execution environment, invocation overrides, runtime variables, adapter type,\nand runtime paths.\n\nThe result of this step is a coherent context for the rest of the command: where the project is, which\nprofile or platform environment is active, which target-like connection context is active, which overrides\napply, and where dbt should read or write support files.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-bb616636691d",
      "originalText": "Load Invocation Context\nResolve the invocation before reading resources: command name, project directory, profile or connection profile, target, execution environment, invocation overrides, runtime variables, adapter type, and runtime paths.\n\nThe result of this step is a coherent context for the rest of the command: where the project is, which profile or platform environment is active, which target-like connection context is active, which overrides apply, and where dbt should read or write support files.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-load-invocation-context"
      }
    },
