      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Project Directory\nThe project directory is the folder dbt treats as the project root. It matters because\n`dbt_project.yml`, configured resource paths, packages, and default artifact paths are resolved\nfrom that root.\n\nIn Core or local Fusion CLI, dbt uses `--project-dir` when supplied; otherwise it searches from\nthe current working directory upward until it finds `dbt_project.yml`. In the dbt platform, the run\nstarts from the configured project repository/code checkout, and dbt evaluates the project\ninside that managed workspace.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-8fe0a1e38c0a",
      "originalText": "Project Directory\nThe project directory is the folder dbt treats as the project root. It matters because `dbt_project.yml`, configured resource paths, packages, and default artifact paths are resolved from that root.\n\nIn Core or local Fusion CLI, dbt uses `--project-dir` when supplied; otherwise it searches from the current working directory upward until it finds `dbt_project.yml`. In the dbt platform, the run starts from the configured project repository/code checkout, and dbt evaluates the project inside that managed workspace.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-project-directory"
      }
    },
    {
