      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Platform Environment\nA dbt platform environment is the managed execution context for Studio IDE, dbt CLI development,\nor scheduled jobs. It defines the dbt version, warehouse connection information, and code version\nto execute.\n\nDevelopment environments use personal development credentials for each developer. Deployment\nenvironments use assigned connection profiles and deployment credentials, with Production,\nStaging, and General deployment types.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-fad37e1b877c",
      "originalText": "Platform Environment\nA dbt platform environment is the managed execution context for Studio IDE, dbt CLI development, or scheduled jobs. It defines the dbt version, warehouse connection information, and code version to execute.\n\nDevelopment environments use personal development credentials for each developer. Deployment environments use assigned connection profiles and deployment credentials, with Production, Staging, and General deployment types.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-platform-environment"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6191989727,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-284c349c179f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3613.0087819404384,
      "y": -2383.8492031795427,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
