      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Platform Connection Profile\nA platform connection profile is not a checked-in `profiles.yml` file. It is a project-level dbt\nplatform object assigned to deployment environments and backed by account-level warehouse\nconnections, deployment credentials, and extended attributes.\n\nExample: a Production environment can use a Snowflake connection profile with a service\naccount, production role, production warehouse, target database, and target schema. A Staging\nenvironment can use a different profile or the same profile with different environment settings.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-4a212148cd74",
      "originalText": "Platform Connection Profile\nA platform connection profile is not a checked-in `profiles.yml` file. It is a project-level dbt platform object assigned to deployment environments and backed by account-level warehouse connections, deployment credentials, and extended attributes.\n\nExample: a Production environment can use a Snowflake connection profile with a service account, production role, production warehouse, target database, and target schema. A Staging environment can use a different profile or the same profile with different environment settings.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-platform-connection-profile"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
