      "width": 596.080078125,
      "height": 140.0,
      "seed": 492009,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Invocation Overrides\nInvocation overrides are the values that change how one command behaves without changing\nsource files. They exist so local development, CI, and production can use the same project with\ndifferent runtime context.\n\nExamples: `--target ci`, `--vars '{\"load_days\": 3}'`, `DBT_PROFILES_DIR`, and platform job\nenvironment variables. For global flags, dbt resolves CLI option > environment variable > `flags:`\nin `dbt_project.yml` > dbt default.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-1b557066a521",
      "originalText": "Invocation Overrides\nInvocation overrides are the values that change how one command behaves without changing source files. They exist so local development, CI, and production can use the same project with different runtime context.\n\nExamples: `--target ci`, `--vars '{\"load_days\": 3}'`, `DBT_PROFILES_DIR`, and platform job environment variables. For global flags, dbt resolves CLI option > environment variable > `flags:` in `dbt_project.yml` > dbt default.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-invocation-overrides"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7648896995,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-6132240b1deb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
