    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3344905926,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-01d302fcde64",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1744.430397620313,
      "y": -1826.0975928206692,
      "strokeColor": "#1F2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 635.8447265625,
      "height": 178.75,
      "seed": 382232,
      "groupIds": [
        "lge0hos9"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Parse Project Files\nFind candidate files from static path config in `dbt_project.yml`. Defaults are relative to the project root: `model-\npaths: [\"models\"]`, `macro-paths: [\"macros\"]`, `seed-paths: [\"seeds\"]`, `snapshot-paths: [\"snapshots\"]`, and\n`test-paths: [\"tests\"]`; custom paths replace those defaults.\n\ndbt reads SQL models, Python models where supported, resource `.yml` files, macros, seeds, snapshots,\nanalyses, singular tests, generic test macros, exposures, metrics, semantic models, and sources from their\nconfigured resource paths. Sources and unit tests are discovered under `model-paths`; seeds are `.csv` files\nunder `seed-paths`; installed packages are read from `packages-install-path`, defaulting to `dbt_packages`.\nStatic parsing and partial parsing can reuse prior parse state from `target/partial_parse.msgpack`, but changes\nto project config, packages, dbt version, profile inputs, or relevant env vars can force broader re-parsing.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-01d302fcde64",
      "originalText": "Parse Project Files\nFind candidate files from static path config in `dbt_project.yml`. Defaults are relative to the project root: `model-paths: [\"models\"]`, `macro-paths: [\"macros\"]`, `seed-paths: [\"seeds\"]`, `snapshot-paths: [\"snapshots\"]`, and `test-paths: [\"tests\"]`; custom paths replace those defaults.\n\ndbt reads SQL models, Python models where supported, resource `.yml` files, macros, seeds, snapshots, analyses, singular tests, generic test macros, exposures, metrics, semantic models, and sources from their configured resource paths. Sources and unit tests are discovered under `model-paths`; seeds are `.csv` files under `seed-paths`; installed packages are read from `packages-install-path`, defaulting to `dbt_packages`. Static parsing and partial parsing can reuse prior parse state from `target/partial_parse.msgpack`, but changes to project config, packages, dbt version, profile inputs, or relevant env vars can force broader re-parsing.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-parse-project"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4478097692,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-1edb85c192e9",
