      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Code Checkout Context\nCode checkout context is where the source files come from before parsing. Core reads\nthe local filesystem; the dbt platform runs against the code version configured for the\nactive environment or job.\n\nExample: a local Core command parses the branch currently checked out in your shell.\nA platform deployment job reclones the repository and uses the environment's default\nbranch or custom branch before running job commands.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-c52166ddde50",
      "originalText": "Code Checkout Context\nCode checkout context is where the source files come from before parsing. Core reads the local filesystem; the dbt platform runs against the code version configured for the active environment or job.\n\nExample: a local Core command parses the branch currently checked out in your shell. A platform deployment job reclones the repository and uses the environment's default branch or custom branch before running job commands.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-code-checkout-context"
      }
    },
