      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Seed Snapshot And Analysis Files\nSeeds, snapshots, and analyses are separate resource classes with\ndifferent runtime behavior. dbt discovers each from its configured path and\nturns it into the appropriate resource type.\n\nExamples: `seeds/country_codes.csv` can be loaded as a seed relation;\n`snapshots/customers_snapshot.sql` defines historical change capture;\n`analyses/revenue_debug.sql` can compile SQL without becoming a built\nmodel.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-2188fe45e7b8",
      "originalText": "Seed Snapshot And Analysis Files\nSeeds, snapshots, and analyses are separate resource classes with different runtime behavior. dbt discovers each from its configured path and turns it into the appropriate resource type.\n\nExamples: `seeds/country_codes.csv` can be loaded as a seed relation; `snapshots/customers_snapshot.sql` defines historical change capture; `analyses/revenue_debug.sql` can compile SQL without becoming a built model.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-seed-snapshot-analysis-files"
      }
    },
