      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Resolve Resource Metadata\nTurn discovered files into resources with package namespace, resource type, name, path, original\nfile path, enabled state, config, properties, columns, tests, docs, groups, contracts, versions, and\nsource declarations.\n\nIdentity comes from resource type + package name + resource name: model names usually come\nfrom file names, source identities come from `sources:` name plus table name, and package\nnamespaces come from each package's `dbt_project.yml` `name`. Config precedence is most-\nspecific-wins: inline `config()` in a resource > `config:` in a resource `.yml` file > path-scoped\nconfig in `dbt_project.yml`; within `dbt_project.yml`, deeper resource paths beat broader paths,\nand root-project config can override installed package config. Most configs clobber less-specific\nvalues; important merge exceptions are additive `tags`, merged `meta`, additive hooks, and key-\nlevel freshness overrides.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-5d13e15a0803",
      "originalText": "Resolve Resource Metadata\nTurn discovered files into resources with package namespace, resource type, name, path, original file path, enabled state, config, properties, columns, tests, docs, groups, contracts, versions, and source declarations.\n\nIdentity comes from resource type + package name + resource name: model names usually come from file names, source identities come from `sources:` name plus table name, and package namespaces come from each package's `dbt_project.yml` `name`. Config precedence is most-specific-wins: inline `config()` in a resource > `config:` in a resource `.yml` file > path-scoped config in `dbt_project.yml`; within `dbt_project.yml`, deeper resource paths beat broader paths, and root-project config can override installed package config. Most configs clobber less-specific values; important merge exceptions are additive `tags`, merged `meta`, additive hooks, and key-level freshness overrides.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-resolve-metadata"
      }
    },
