    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1187939639,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-83a9a989bccd",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2600.264560942125,
      "y": -1072.689280916432,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 526.06640625,
      "height": 122.5,
      "seed": 707767,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "`ref()` Edge\n`ref()` tells dbt that one dbt-managed resource depends on another dbt-managed\nresource. It creates a graph edge and later compiles to the physical relation name for\nthe active target.\n\nExample: `select * from {{ ref('stg_orders') }}` means this model cannot run until\n`stg_orders` is available. `ref('orders', version=1)` pins a versioned model contract.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-83a9a989bccd",
      "originalText": "`ref()` Edge\n`ref()` tells dbt that one dbt-managed resource depends on another dbt-managed resource. It creates a graph edge and later compiles to the physical relation name for the active target.\n\nExample: `select * from {{ ref('stg_orders') }}` means this model cannot run until `stg_orders` is available. `ref('orders', version=1)` pins a versioned model contract.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-ref-edge"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4285619606,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-b36af4de1db9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3250.455277447079,
      "y": -1075.029733026047,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 584.1305663933787,
      "height": 140.21694281144823,
      "seed": 181425,
      "groupIds": [],
