    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8890015929,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-b36af4de1db9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3257.4277872062685,
      "y": -1070.029733026047,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 570.185546875,
      "height": 105.0,
      "seed": 251049,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "`source()` Edge\n`source()` tells dbt that a model depends on an externally loaded or externally owned\nrelation declared in YAML. It creates lineage and enables source tests, docs, and freshness.\n\nExample: `{{ source('stripe', 'payments') }}` looks up `sources: - name: stripe` and `tables: -\nname: payments`, then compiles to the configured database, schema, and identifier.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b36af4de1db9",
      "originalText": "`source()` Edge\n`source()` tells dbt that a model depends on an externally loaded or externally owned relation declared in YAML. It creates lineage and enables source tests, docs, and freshness.\n\nExample: `{{ source('stripe', 'payments') }}` looks up `sources: - name: stripe` and `tables: - name: payments`, then compiles to the configured database, schema, and identifier.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-source-edge"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
