    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5651747454,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-50affc7e2c94",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1782.4945309069208,
      "y": -887.7398352635164,
      "strokeColor": "#1F2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 549.19921875,
      "height": 146.25,
      "seed": 852867,
      "groupIds": [
        "lge0hos9"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Build Manifest And DAG\nAssemble the parsed project into the manifest graph before command selection is applied. The\nmanifest includes enabled resources plus metadata collections such as `nodes`, `sources`,\n`macros`, `docs`, `metrics`, `exposures`, `groups`, selectors, disabled resources, `parent_map`,\n`child_map`, and `group_map`.\n\nThe manifest represents the whole parsed project, not just the nodes that this command will\nexecute. dbt can use the graph in memory during the invocation and can also persist it for docs,\nstate comparison, deferral, Mesh, observability, and other artifact consumers.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-50affc7e2c94",
      "originalText": "Build Manifest And DAG\nAssemble the parsed project into the manifest graph before command selection is applied. The manifest includes enabled resources plus metadata collections such as `nodes`, `sources`, `macros`, `docs`, `metrics`, `exposures`, `groups`, selectors, disabled resources, `parent_map`, `child_map`, and `group_map`.\n\nThe manifest represents the whole parsed project, not just the nodes that this command will execute. dbt can use the graph in memory during the invocation and can also persist it for docs, state comparison, deferral, Mesh, observability, and other artifact consumers.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-build-manifest"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6360009033,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-09f278b21cd6",
