    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3389004290,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-09f278b21cd6",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2816.883803966374,
      "y": -866.4014500740434,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 443.10546875,
      "height": 140.0,
      "seed": 984900,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Manifest\nThe manifest is dbt's parsed, machine-readable view of the project. It is\nthe operational schema for lineage, docs, selection, CI, deferral,\nobservability, and Mesh metadata.\n\nExample: `target/manifest.json` records a model's unique id, original file\npath, compiled path, config, columns, depends-on list, and relation\nmetadata.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-09f278b21cd6",
      "originalText": "Manifest\nThe manifest is dbt's parsed, machine-readable view of the project. It is the operational schema for lineage, docs, selection, CI, deferral, observability, and Mesh metadata.\n\nExample: `target/manifest.json` records a model's unique id, original file path, compiled path, config, columns, depends-on list, and relation metadata.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-manifest"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8496538436,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-161843113a5a",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3325.165311103051,
      "y": -880.3027214849174,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 520.2250885481368,
      "height": 151.89421657664616,
