      "width": 505.107421875,
      "height": 140.0,
      "seed": 955643,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Compiled SQL\nCompiled SQL is the SQL after Jinja, refs, sources, macros, config, schema\nnaming, and quoting have been resolved. It is the best artifact for debugging what\nthe warehouse actually saw.\n\nExample: a model file containing `{{ ref('stg_orders') }}` compiles to a concrete\nrelation name plus expanded CTEs, adapter syntax, and materialization-specific\nSQL.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-72a8b3b7cd78",
      "originalText": "Compiled SQL\nCompiled SQL is the SQL after Jinja, refs, sources, macros, config, schema naming, and quoting have been resolved. It is the best artifact for debugging what the warehouse actually saw.\n\nExample: a model file containing `{{ ref('stg_orders') }}` compiles to a concrete relation name plus expanded CTEs, adapter syntax, and materialization-specific SQL.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-compiled-sql"
      }
    },
