    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3253007176,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-4371b73889e6",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1801.048778496514,
      "y": 413.6144345403011,
      "strokeColor": "#1F2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 520.19677734375,
      "height": 162.5,
      "seed": 783773,
      "groupIds": [
        "lge0hos9"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Execute In DAG Order\nExecute the selected subgraph in topological order: a node becomes eligible only after its\nselected upstream dependencies, required hooks, and materialization prerequisites are\nsatisfied. Independent branches can run concurrently up to `threads`, adapter limits,\nwarehouse limits, and engine scheduling behavior.\n\nThe active connection context and materialization macros decide the concrete warehouse\noperations: create view, create table, merge incremental data, build snapshot tables, load\nseed CSVs, run tests, or execute hooks. Runtime failures, `--fail-fast`, retries, transactions,\nand adapter responses affect what later nodes can run and what status is recorded.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-4371b73889e6",
      "originalText": "Execute In DAG Order\nExecute the selected subgraph in topological order: a node becomes eligible only after its selected upstream dependencies, required hooks, and materialization prerequisites are satisfied. Independent branches can run concurrently up to `threads`, adapter limits, warehouse limits, and engine scheduling behavior.\n\nThe active connection context and materialization macros decide the concrete warehouse operations: create view, create table, merge incremental data, build snapshot tables, load seed CSVs, run tests, or execute hooks. Runtime failures, `--fail-fast`, retries, transactions, and adapter responses affect what later nodes can run and what status is recorded.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-execute-dag"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8417360232,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-9399432bb1f8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
