      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hooks And Operations\nHooks and operations run SQL or macros around\nnormal resource execution. They are useful for\ngrants, audit logging, session settings, and\nadapter-specific setup.\n\nExamples: `pre-hook` can set a warehouse role\nor delete a partition; `post-hook` can apply\ngrants; `on-run-end` can log run metadata\nafter all selected resources finish.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-6663e4489bb8",
      "originalText": "Hooks And Operations\nHooks and operations run SQL or macros around normal resource execution. They are useful for grants, audit logging, session settings, and adapter-specific setup.\n\nExamples: `pre-hook` can set a warehouse role or delete a partition; `post-hook` can apply grants; `on-run-end` can log run metadata after all selected resources finish.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-hooks-operations"
      }
    },
