      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "`manifest.json` Artifact\n`manifest.json` is the persisted parsed project graph. It describes\nwhat dbt understood before execution results are considered.\n\nExample: docs generation, lineage tools, state comparison, and\nMesh metadata use the manifest to inspect resource configs,\ndependencies, owners, contracts, and compiled paths.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-422b1c9c6222",
      "originalText": "`manifest.json` Artifact\n`manifest.json` is the persisted parsed project graph. It describes what dbt understood before execution results are considered.\n\nExample: docs generation, lineage tools, state comparison, and Mesh metadata use the manifest to inspect resource configs, dependencies, owners, contracts, and compiled paths.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-manifest-json-artifact"
      }
    },
