      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "`run_results.json` Artifact\n`run_results.json` is the persisted execution trace for the selected\nresources in one invocation. It answers what ran, how long it took,\nand what status or adapter response came back.\n\nExample: observability tooling can join `unique_id`, timing, status,\n`adapter_response`, and `relation_name` to warehouse query history\nor scheduler metadata.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-c14d347f6713",
      "originalText": "`run_results.json` Artifact\n`run_results.json` is the persisted execution trace for the selected resources in one invocation. It answers what ran, how long it took, and what status or adapter response came back.\n\nExample: observability tooling can join `unique_id`, timing, status, `adapter_response`, and `relation_name` to warehouse query history or scheduler metadata.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-run-results-json-artifact"
      }
    },
