      "seed": 864075,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Artifact Consumers\nArtifact consumers are workflows that read dbt outputs after the command\nfinishes. Their correctness depends on reading artifacts from the right\nenvironment and invocation.\n\nExamples: docs reads manifest and catalog-style metadata; slim CI reads\na previous manifest for `state:modified`; deferral reads prior relation\nlocations; cost attribution joins run results to warehouse query history.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-69ae98e65df5",
      "originalText": "Artifact Consumers\nArtifact consumers are workflows that read dbt outputs after the command finishes. Their correctness depends on reading artifacts from the right environment and invocation.\n\nExamples: docs reads manifest and catalog-style metadata; slim CI reads a previous manifest for `state:modified`; deferral reads prior relation locations; cost attribution joins run results to warehouse query history.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-lifecycle-artifact-consumers"
      }
    },
