      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "File Path Is Not Identity\nA folder layout is an authoring convenience;\nthe manifest resource identity is what dbt\nuses operationally. Renaming paths and\nrenaming resources have different blast radii.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-2e1c339be6bf",
      "originalText": "File Path Is Not Identity\nA folder layout is an authoring convenience; the manifest resource identity is what dbt uses operationally. Renaming paths and renaming resources have different blast radii.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-file-path-not-identity"
      }
    },
