      "text": "`dbt_project.yml` Defaults\n`dbt_project.yml` sets project identity,\nresource paths, default configs, model\nsubdirectory behavior, variables, seeds,\nsnapshots, hooks, and package-level overrides.",
      "fontSize": 14,
