      "text": "Project Dependencies\nProject dependencies are declared in\n`dependencies.yml` and support dbt Mesh by\nresolving public models from another project\nthrough metadata rather than copying that\nproject source code into your project.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-5dade8e3c7f2",
      "originalText": "Project Dependencies\nProject dependencies are declared in `dependencies.yml` and support dbt Mesh by resolving public models from another project through metadata rather than copying that project source code into your project.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbt-project-dependencies"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
