      "locked": false,
      "text": "Parent And Child Maps\n`parent_map` and `child_map` are the\noperational DAG indexes. They let tools answer\nupstream, downstream, blast radius, and\nownership questions without reparsing SQL.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-fe1b49229f08",
