      "text": "Run Results\n`run_results.json` records what dbt executed:\nresource status, timing, failures, adapter\nresponse, compiled code, and relation names.\nIt is the execution trace, not just a success\nflag.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
