      "text": "Local Control\nCore is simple to embed in external\norchestrators and local workflows. You own\ndependency management, secrets, scheduling,\nartifact storage, docs hosting, and\noperational observability.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-14c5dfe6ee07",
      "originalText": "Local Control\nCore is simple to embed in external orchestrators and local workflows. You own dependency management, secrets, scheduling, artifact storage, docs hosting, and operational observability.",
